                <p>Source: Central Intelligence Agency, DCI Files: Job 91-00741R, Box 1, Mongoose
                    Papers. Secret; Eyes Only. Prepared by McCone. The memorandum apparently records
                    a meeting of the Special Group (Augmented).</p>
            </note>
